SDL-E1030 (spec/index.md)

  x HNSW parameter `m` cannot be larger than 127
   ,----
 1 | index hnsw v { on: t; fields: a; dimension: 8; m: 200; };
   :                                              |
   :                                              `-- outside this kind's domain
   `----
